#: ../../source/index.rst:8 06779e86d03740988dfc6cef4f28d6d2
msgid ""
"Transfer Orbit Design 是 `e2m2e <https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e>`_"
" 的 GUI 前端：e2m2e 提供地月空间轨道设计所需的动力学模型与算法，本仓库把它们封装 成可视化桌面应用（Tauri 2：Rust 壳 + "
"React 前端 + e2m2e sidecar）。八个工具 （含参数空间扫描与分区边界）与 catalog "
"的标注/提升/导出/删除操作均已可用； 画布为结果层/固定层双层模型，附时间轴走查与地月空间分区图层；内嵌 AI 助手 "
"（LLM+MCP）可对话式发起计算，会话跨重启持久化。"
msgstr "Transfer Orbit Design is the GUI frontend of `e2m2e <https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e>`_: e2m2e provides the dynamics models and algorithms for cislunar orbit design, and this repository wraps them into a visual desktop application (Tauri 2: Rust shell + React frontend + e2m2e sidecar). Eight tools (including the parameter sweep and spatiography boundaries) and the catalog annotate/promote/export/delete operations are all available; the canvas uses a two-layer result/pinned model with a timeline scrubber and the cislunar partition layer; an embedded AI assistant (LLM+MCP) drives computations conversationally, with sessions persisting across restarts."

